[I] Terminal editor

[T] The chr terminal editor is inspired by the turbo pascal editor using Turbo
[T] Vision from the year 1997. For the keyboard shortcut he should be similar
[T] gedit, to facilitate the transition from desktop to console editor.

[U] https://github.com/chr-editor/chr

[A] istoph
[M] Chriwro <chrisiwro@gmail.com>

[C] extra/editor
[F] CROSS

[E] opt qt5base

[L] BSL
[V] 0.1.82

[D] b055a34ce8e292db5d58707f3302f755b7840a3f58cbd49cd3777d5b chr-0.1.82.tar.gz https://github.com/chr-editor/chr/archive/0.1.82/

pkginstalled qt6base && var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dqt=qt6 &&
	atstage cross && var_append PATH : "$root/TOOLCHAIN/cross/qt/libexec/qt6"
pkginstalled syntax-highlighting && var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dsyntax_highlighting=true
